DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN,anthropic.auth0.com
DOMAIN,anthropic.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,servd-anthropic-website.b-cdn.net

# Gemini / AI Studio / NotebookLM / Gemini Code Assist
# SOURCE: https://ai.google.dev/api/all-methods
# SOURCE: https://cloud.google.com/gemini/docs/codeassist/set-up-gemini
# 精确匹配共享 Google 服务的 AI 主机，不接管全部 google.com/googleapis.com。
DOMAIN,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN,notebook.google
DOMAIN,notebook.google.com
DOMAIN,labs.google
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudaicompanion.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,serviceusage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudresourcemanager.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,firebaselogging-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,feedback-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,apihub.googleapis.com

# GitHub Copilot / Microsoft Copilot
# SOURCE: https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/copilot-allowlist-reference
# GitHub 通用登录/API 继续沿用 GitHub 分流，不把整个 GitHub 归到 AI。
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,origin-tracker.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,default.exp-tas.com

